u2014 this is the root cause of the 'no UI' complaint; evidenced at ModelCookbookPage.jsx:158-163."}, {"id": "model_management_plan_gap_g2", "label": "Gap G2: Cookbook and Runtime unlinked", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/model-management-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "High severity \u2014 no 'pull into my runtime' action from a suggestion; ModelCookbookPage imports only getModelSuggestions/getSystemProfile, unaware of runtime state."}, {"id": "model_management_plan_gap_g3", "label": "Gap G3: Pulls have no live progress", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/model-management-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Medium severity \u2014 OllamaModelPuller.pull uses stream:false and blocks up to 30 minutes; dashboard pulls map only holds pulling/failed status strings, no percentage."}, {"id": "model_management_plan_gap_g4", "label": "Gap G4: No runtime-reachability guidance on Cookbook", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/model-management-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Medium severity \u2014 Cookbook never checks the runtime dashboard, so it can't tell the user to deploy Ollama first."}, {"id": "model_management_plan_gap_g5", "label": "Gap G5: Runtime pull is free-text only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/model-management-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Low severity \u2014 RuntimePage.jsx pull input has no browse/validate of tags."}, {"id": "model_management_plan_gap_g6", "label": "Gap G6: Agent pullModel blocks with no progress feedback", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/model-management-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_ur